g=json.loads((S/'guide-provenance.json').read_text());pair='west-north'
prompt='''Create FOUR complete adult Marsh game sprites in one horizontal row with wide transparent empty gutters. THREE intermediate whole-body cargo turns from WEST screenLEFT side toward NORTH BACK facing away,then one NEUTRAL NORTH back standing ruler. ReferenceONE paired selected West/North idles is PRIMARY small adult head/body/limb proportions,elevated camera and quiet warm matte pixel grade. LEFT boardfigure West faces LEFT,RIGHT boardfigure North faces AWAY;keep those board positions. ReferenceTWO paired exact staged cargo endpoints gives original rigid slate waist case,connected bent supporting arms and body identity. ReferenceTHREE own originalWEST preserves bare visible temple and authentic ankle buckles;referenceFOUR own originalNORTH preserves backhair/backplate/harness/pouches and anatomicalRIGHT implant at back viewerRIGHT edge. Never mirror an East figure. All turns go toward BACK,not front.
Figure1 yaw22.5degrees away from West toward North:shallow REAR-LEFT quarter. Backplate starts to appear;front chest disappears. Face only a diminishing LEFT profile,head/torso/hips/case rotate together toward away. Same rigid slate case held IN FRONT of his waist along heading,slightly visible at screenLEFT as torso begins occluding it. Near and far gloves support case with natural occlusion,bent arms close to waist,no arm swing. Gentle short low pivot/step consistent with endpoints,not run/high knee/squat.
Figure2 yaw45degrees:clear REAR-LEFT three-quarter,backplate/harness/pouches visible,only small LEFT ear/face edge,no frontal eyes portrait. Case ahead of wearer becomes mostly hidden by torso,visible around screenLEFT side only,not on back. Near elbow at side,forearm extends forward into naturally occluded hand,far arm partly hidden. Small adult head/full adult limbs and fitted gear same size,elevated camera,quiet warm ivory/sage/slate/charcoal matte pixel clusters.
Figure3 yaw67.5degrees:nearly NORTH BACK,only22.5degrees toward screenLEFT from straight back. Mostly back of head,no frontal face,backplate near frontal to viewer. Case is held IN FRONT away from viewer,nearly fully hidden,at most narrow screenLEFT edge. Never put crate across backplate or lower back. Correct North endpoint weight:VIEWER LEFT boot planted flat at LOWEST floor level under supporting straight left shin,VIEWER RIGHT boot gently RAISED behind with rear sole visible. This is back view:actorLEFT=viewerLEFT supports,actorRIGHT=viewerRIGHT recovers. Preserve that support into exact North endpoint,no reversed weight/both airborne. Hands support hidden case in front,not across back. AnatomicalRIGHT implant remains far from West visible bare temple and becomes only tiny rear viewerRIGHT edge as back view opens,never copied to viewerLEFT.
Figure4 exact NEUTRAL NORTH BACK ruler from RIGHT figure of PRIMARY referenceONE,arms relaxed down,no crate,unobstructed hair-to-sole adult. One146 occupied neutral calibration,184canvas,p92/172,H148,no per-pose/cargo-width fitting. All four complete figures with same camera/body/head/limb/equipment size and material. No floor/background/shadow/glow/haze/text/labels. THREE REAR-LEFT yaws from LEFT side to BACK;front-held slatecase disappears behind body,never becomes backpack. OwnWest bare visible temple,ownNorth rear gear,authentic ankle hardware.'''
p=S/'west-north-01.prompt.txt';assert not p.exists();p.write_text(prompt+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
refs=[S/f'{pair}-body-primary.png',S/f'{pair}-cargo-endpoints.png',ROOT/g['ownOriginalMasters']['west']['path'],ROOT/g['ownOriginalMasters']['north']['path']]
frames=[g[k][f] for k in ['primaryIdles','stagedEndpoints'] for f in ['west','north']]
(S/'west-north-01.request.json').write_text(json.dumps({'normalAdmission':False,'fullGoalComplete':False,'status':'frozen before generation; not started','promptSha256':sha(p),'orderedReferences':[{'path':q.relative_to(ROOT).as_posix(),'sha256':sha(q)} for q in refs],'sourceFrames':frames,'guideDependencies':[{'path':'tools/prepare_marsh_carry_turn_material_guides.py','sha256':sha(ROOT/'tools/prepare_marsh_carry_turn_material_guides.py')}],'sheetGrid':[4,1],'transparentBackground':True,'intermediateYawsFromWestDegrees':[22.5,45,67.5],'neutralOccupiedTargetHeight':146},indent=2)+'\n')
